    "body": "The Reserve Bank of India has shortened the swap facility window for FCNR(B) deposits. This decision comes after observing higher-than-expected foreign currency inflows into the country. The central bank received substantial dollar inflows through these special measures announced earlier. FCNR(B) deposits accounted for the bulk of these significant foreign currency inflows. The swap scheme for other borrowings will continue as originally planned.",
