    "canonicalUrl": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/anchor-investors-stay-put-after-ipo-lock-in-but-half-their-bets-are-gone-within-a-year-sebi/articleshow/133242283.cms",
    "headline": "Anchor investors stay put after IPO lock-in expiry, but half their bets are gone within a year: Sebi",
    "body": "A SEBI study of 242 mainboard IPOs found anchor investors sell gradually after lock-in periods, with about 51% of original allotment value exiting within a year. FPIs recorded the highest one-year exit rate, while smaller IPOs saw faster selling.",
