    "headline": "India’s digital logistics tracking platform crosses 10 crore EXIM container tracking milestone",
    "body": "India's Logistics Data Bank has successfully tracked ten crore export-import containers. This digital platform enhances domestic manufacturing and international trade corridor expansion. Technology integration simplifies and speeds up logistics operations across the nation. The system monitors container movements using RFID and IoT technologies. This milestone supports India's vision for a developed nation.",
