    "headline": "Rupee logs weekly decline, with RBI intervention curbing losses",
    "body": "The Indian rupee faced a challenging week, depreciating against the dollar amidst mounting tensions from the Middle East conflict. Despite this, central bank interventions and steady dollar sales by state banks helped mitigate more significant losses. With India relying on imports for about ninety percent of its oil, the economy remains susceptible to supply disruptions.",
