    "canonicalUrl": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/economy/indicators/cag-flags-rs-25085-crore-tax-effect-from-1902-assessment-lapses/articleshow/133227130.cms",
    "headline": "CAG flags Rs 25,085 crore tax effect from 1,902 assessment lapses",
    "body": "The CAG identified 1,902 tax lapses involving over twenty-five thousand crore rupees. These cases involved incorrect tax rates and faulty income computations. Many lapses occurred after demonetisation during the 2017-18 assessment year. Assessing officers failed to apply relevant sections in numerous unexplained transaction cases. This resulted in under-assessment of tax in the majority of identified instances.",
    "source": {
      "publisher": "Economic Times",
