    "headline": "India, US remain in regular contact on proposed trade deal: Commerce Secretary",
    "body": "India remains in regular contact with the United States regarding their proposed trade deal. Both nations are committed to the framework agreement reached earlier this year. The US recently imposed a ten percent duty on Indian goods due to labor concerns. Washington is also considering further tariffs on India for Russian oil imports. India continues to actively engage US authorities to resolve outstanding trade issues.",
